[[File:Molanisk icon.png|left]]
'''Molanisks''' are [[Slayer monsters]] that require level 39 [[Slayer]] to kill giving 52 Slayer [[experience]] per kill. A [[Slayer bell]] is necessary to initiate combat with them. Since they are only found in the [[Dorgesh-Kaan South Dungeon]], completion of [[Death to the Dorgeshuun]] is required to fight molanisks and it is advisable to bring a [[Light sources|light source]]. Molanisks do unusually low damage, meaning a player with half-decent [[armour]] should easily be able to kill them with no trouble.

They are mainly hunted for their [[earth emerald]] drop, or as a Slayer assignment from [[Vannaka]].

