==Strategy==
[[File:Molanisk hiding.png|thumb|170px|left|A molanisk disguised on a wall.]]
Molanisks are found attached to cave walls and must be lured off with a [[Slayer bell]] to allow players to attack them. The Slayer bell only works within 3 tiles of the wall the molanisk is attached to. When lured off the wall, they are [[Aggressiveness|aggressive]] towards the player who lured them off with the bell. Molanisks [[Spawning|respawn]] relatively quickly, so players who want to conserve [[Energy|run energy]] can just stay at the same respawn location. Alternatively, there is a spot south of the [[fairy rings|fairy ring]] with two spawns close together.  

Molanisks are relatively weak to both [[Crush weapons|crush]] and [[magic]] attacks.

If you are getting attacked by another monster, for example a [[Cave Crawler]], and then use the Slayer bell, the Molanisk will attack you and the monster initially attacking you will lose its aggression.
